\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Five-way ablation on SciERC (551 docs, Qwen3-8B, zero-shot). $\Delta $DR: relative change vs.\ unconstrained; Tot.\ = DR + CF; bold = best (CF excluded). F1 (\%). S1/S2 = single/two-pass (\S  \ref {sec:strategies}). Grammar = grammar-constrained decoding (GCD) ceiling~\citep  {geng2023gcd}. $\dagger $vLLM \texttt  {guided\_json}~\citep  {kwon2023vllm} (\S  \ref {sec:constrained-baselines}). Deterministic (greedy, $T{=}$0); robustness evidence in Table~\ref {tab:cross-model} and Appendices~\ref {app:bootstrap-effect-sizes},~\ref {app:prompt-sensitivity},~\ref {app:doc-length},~\ref {app:sampling}.}}{7}{table.caption.24}\protected@file@percent }
